       * @param {string} pFilename - Filename (extension added automatically)                                                                                                                                                                                  
       * @param {string|Promise|ArrayBuffer|Uint8Array} pContext - Excel data                                                                                                                                                                                  
       * @param {string} [pMimeType] - MIME type (defaults to Excel MIME type)                                                                                                                                                                                 
       * @returns {Promise<void>}                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
